{'symbol': 'GOOGL', 'date': '2022-10-26 08:30:00', 'title': 'ESE ENTERTAINMENT GAMING TECHNOLOGY DIVISION BECOMES GOOGLE PARTNER', 'text': 'VANCOUVER, BC / ACCESSWIRE / OCTOBER 26, 2022 / ESE ENTERTAINMENT INC. ("ESE" OR THE "COMPANY") (TSXV:ESE)(OTCQX:ENTEF), A GAMING AND ESPORTS COMPANY THAT PROVIDES A RANGE OF TECHNOLOGY AND SERVICES TO LEADING VIDEO GAME DEVELOPERS, IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT ITS GAMING TECHNOLOGY DIVISION HAS BECOME A CERTIFIED GOOGLE PARTNER. THE CERTIFICATION FROM GOOGLE (NASDAQ: GOOGL) RECOGNIZES ESE\'S EXPERTISE IN DEVELOPING AND DELIVERING SUCCESSFUL ADVERTISING CAMPAIGNS AND HELPING CLIENTS GET RESULTS.'}